  "notes": "{浮|う}かぶ means to float or to come to mind.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive (⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧)\n- Pair: ⟦{浮|う}かべる→浮かべる：13314_ukaberu⟧ (transitive - to float something, to bring to mind)\n- Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{浮|う}かぶ\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- {浮|う}かんで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: Is floating / has come to mind (state)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{浮|う}かぶ (to come to mind)\n- ⟦{考|かんが}え→考え：00855_kangae⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{浮|う}かぶ (an idea occurs)\n- ⟦{思|おも}い→思い：10248_omoi⟧{浮|う}かぶ (to recall, to come to mind)\n- ⟦{顔|かお}→顔：00558_kao⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{浮|う}かぶ (to appear on one's face)\n- ⟦{水|みず}→水：02258_mizu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{浮|う}かぶ (to float on water)",
